        "answer": "Yes, that's correct.",
        "question": "If I have exactly 3 cards in my security stack, do I activate both the \"1 of your opponent's Digimon gets -7000 DP for the turn\" effect and the \"delete 1 of their unsuspended Digimon\" effect when activating this card's [When Digivolving] [End of Attack] effect?",
