      },
      {
        "answer": "If you have 2 or fewer cards in your security stack when the effect activates, repeat <Recovery +1 (Deck)> until there are 3 cards in your security stack. You don't have to do anything when the effect activates if you have 3 or more cards in your security stack.",
        "question": "How exactly do I perform \"<Recovery +1 (Deck)> until there are 3 cards in your security stack\" in this card’s [On Deletion] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
